(7745040, 1278279, 75585, '<td valign="top">This makes me so very sad.  Great capture - hope it is staged, because it makes me sad to think it isnt. Not sure on the processing, not my fav BUT I think you are trying to minimize the clutter.  Not sure it was necessary.  &lt;not voting yet&gt;<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2023-05-24 00:08:26.</i></td>', 'This makes me so very sad.  Great capture - hope it is staged, because it makes me sad to think it isnt. Not sure on the processing, not my fav BUT I think you are trying to minimize the clutter.  Not sure it was necessary.  <not voting yet>', '2023-05-17 01:26:03.000000', '2023-05-24 01:08:26.000000', 1),
