(7745874, 1278275, 67145, '<td valign="top">it wasn''t until I opened this that I got the full impact ..  <br/>brilliant ..!!.. <br/>would love to know how you achieved something like this .. :)</td>', 'it wasn''t until I opened this that I got the full impact ..  brilliant ..!!.. would love to know how you achieved something like this .. :)', '2023-05-24 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(7745893, 1278275, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> it wasn''t until I opened this that I got the full impact ..  <br/>brilliant ..!!.. <br/>would love to know how you achieved something like this .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks roz. Very simple really. Pencil through the apple and a couple of kind worms who volunteered to be models in exchange for some free apple juice. Makes a break from digesting soil. I sat the apple on white plastic board which was a bad idea as it reflected the blue sky above onto it causing a blue tinge which probably looks even worse to non colour blind people.</td>', 'Originally posted by roz: it wasn''t until I opened this that I got the full impact ..  brilliant ..!!.. would love to know how you achieved something like this .. :)   Thanks roz. Very simple really. Pencil through the apple and a couple of kind worms who volunteered to be models in exchange for some free apple juice. Makes a break from digesting soil. I sat the apple on white plastic board which was a bad idea as it reflected the blue sky above onto it causing a blue tinge which probably looks even worse to non colour blind people.', '2023-05-25 07:23:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(7745982, 1278275, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by P-A-U-L:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by roz:</b></div><hr/><i> it wasn''t until I opened this that I got the full impact ..  <br/>brilliant ..!!.. <br/>would love to know how you achieved something like this .. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks roz. Very simple really. Pencil through the apple and a couple of kind worms who volunteered to be models in exchange for some free apple juice. Makes a break from digesting soil. I sat the apple on white plastic board which was a bad idea as it reflected the blue sky above onto it causing a blue tinge which probably looks even worse to non colour blind people. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>AMAZING .. !! .. i actually saw it first on my phone but didnt open it .. thought it was just a bad apple .. didnt realize the extent of your commitment .. lol .. <br/>looks like you put a few ppl off seeing the voting .. although that may not have been the cause .. maybe they were jealous of your imaginative approach .. ;)<br/>thanks for letting me know your secrets .. <br/>ps.. i must say .. those worms were extremely obliging .. you must be a worm whisperer .. !! .. ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by P-A-U-L: Originally posted by roz: it wasn''t until I opened this that I got the full impact ..  brilliant ..!!.. would love to know how you achieved something like this .. :)   Thanks roz. Very simple really. Pencil through the apple and a couple of kind worms who volunteered to be models in exchange for some free apple juice. Makes a break from digesting soil. I sat the apple on white plastic board which was a bad idea as it reflected the blue sky above onto it causing a blue tinge which probably looks even worse to non colour blind people.   AMAZING .. !! .. i actually saw it first on my phone but didnt open it .. thought it was just a bad apple .. didnt realize the extent of your commitment .. lol .. looks like you put a few ppl off seeing the voting .. although that may not have been the cause .. maybe they were jealous of your imaginative approach .. ;)thanks for letting me know your secrets .. ps.. i must say .. those worms were extremely obliging .. you must be a worm whisperer .. !! .. ;)', '2023-05-25 17:27:32.000000', NULL, 0),
